    {
      "type": "sectionHeader",
      "title": "Iraq | Toyota Crown",
      "subtitle": "Launching Campaign"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "body": "This car model is known for its cultural connection with Iraqi society, and its sentimental meaning to many generations. It has been known as the long-life car in the country for the last 40 years in Iraq, and has been called several affectionate names \u2014 names that come from the deep side of the street, and from the relationship between the user's emotion, their memories, and the stability of the car across all those decades."
    },
    {
      "type": "fullBleed",
      "image": "crown-01-iraq-architecture.jpg",
      "size": "contained",
      "widthPercent": 80
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "body": "Iraq is a land rich in religious diversity and historical roots. The country is a testament to the coexistence and intermingling of various faiths throughout its history \u2014 home to ancient communities such as Christians, Yazidis, Mandaeans and Sabians, who have preserved their distinct beliefs and traditions for centuries. This variety made the challenge big in our brainstorming: to find a mutual point between all these parts, and relate it to an automotive campaign."
    },
    {
      "type": "fullBleed",
      "image": "crown-02-heritage-reborn.jpg",
      "caption": "Heritage Reborn \u2014 campaign concept board",
      "size": "contained",
      "widthPercent": 80
    },
    {
      "type": "fullBleed",
      "image": "crown-03-deq-arabian-tattoos.jpg",
      "caption": "DEQ \u2014 ancient Arabian tattoos, the visual root of the campaign",
      "size": "contained",
      "widthPercent": 80
    },
    {
      "type": "sectionHeader",
      "title": "Teaser"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "body": "We shot historical locations without the Crown, and wrote sentimental phrases in a vintage typographic style, taken as snippets from the documentary. For the reveal, we shot the same locations with the all-new Toyota Crown centering them, using the campaign slogan and the old DEQ language.",
      "list": [
        "\u0641\u062e\u0627\u0645\u0629\u064c \u0625\u0633\u062a\u0645\u0631\u0651\u062a \u0644\u0623\u062c\u064a\u0627\u0644\u064d",
        "\u0647\u064a \u0625\u0631\u062b\u064c \u0645\u0646 \u0627\u0644\u0630\u0643\u0631\u064a\u0627\u062a",
        "\u0639\u0631\u0627\u0642\u0629 \u062a\u0638\u0647\u0631 \u0628\u0623\u062f\u0642 \u062a\u0641\u0627\u0635\u064a\u0644\u0647\u0627",
